        { "type": "urlHostEquals", "urlKey": "CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL", "hostKey": "WEB_DOMAIN" },
        {
          "description": "Every one of these keys is interpolated into a Caddy site address. Two site blocks sharing one address is not a routing mistake that shows up as a 404 - caddy fails to start and the whole edge goes down on the next recreate. mustDifferFrom is pairwise and cannot close a set, so the set is checked here. Comparison is by normalized host, because a duplicate spelled with different case is still the same address to Caddy. Omitting an optional key does not remove its vhost either: Caddy's `{$VAR:default}` keeps serving the default address, so fallbacks below lists the Caddyfile default of every key and the check treats an unset key as occupying that address. Without it, a set value equal to an unset key's default (PRODUCT_DOMAIN unset + APEX_DOMAIN=product.localhost) passes the contract and takes the edge down on the next caddy recreate. The table is verified against the Caddyfile itself by tools/test/env-contract.test.mjs, so a default renamed there cannot leave a stale entry here.",
          "type": "allDistinct",
          "keys": [
            "WEB_DOMAIN",
            "COMPANY_DOMAIN",
            "PRODUCT_DOMAIN",
            "APEX_DOMAIN",
            "MONITOR_DOMAIN",
            "GRAFANA_DOMAIN",
            "PROMETHEUS_DOMAIN"
          ],
          "fallbacks": {
            "WEB_DOMAIN": "web.localhost",
            "COMPANY_DOMAIN": "company.localhost",
            "PRODUCT_DOMAIN": "product.localhost",
            "APEX_DOMAIN": "apex.localhost",
            "MONITOR_DOMAIN": "status.localhost",
            "GRAFANA_DOMAIN": "grafana.localhost",
            "PROMETHEUS_DOMAIN": "prometheus.localhost"
          },
          "asHost": true
        },
        {
          "description": "The apex vhost's redirect target is {$COMPANY_DOMAIN}. With APEX_DOMAIN set and COMPANY_DOMAIN unset, the apex would 308 every visitor to the unreachable company.localhost default - a live public host pointing at nothing, which reads as a working redirect in the config and as a dead site to the visitor.",
          "type": "requiresKey",
          "key": "APEX_DOMAIN",
          "requires": "COMPANY_DOMAIN"
        },
        {
          "description": "The auth cookie Domain is the front/back shared suffix, so every front-derived value must move together. The single same-origin topology is selected by CUSTOM_PROD_BACKURL: CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL must equal its frontHost (error), urlHostEquals(CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL, WEB_DOMAIN) pins WEB_DOMAIN to that host (error), and requiredWhen makes WEB_DOMAIN mandatory. The remaining front-derived values are compared against the same topology by host, not raw spelling, because HOME_SERVER_ENV values can differ in trailing slash or case. deploy.yml pins the same table. The table itself is checked against the invariants below, so a wrong entry cannot pass by simply matching.",
          "type": "cookieDomainScope",
          "switchUrlKey": "CUSTOM_PROD_BACKURL",
          "domainKey": "CUSTOM_PROD_COOKIEDOMAIN",
          "frontUrlKey": "CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL",
          "webDomainKey": "WEB_DOMAIN",
          "publicEdgeProbeUrlKey": "PUBLIC_EDGE_PROBE_BASE_URL",
          "revalidateUrlKey": "CUSTOM__REVALIDATE__URL",
          "adminEmbedOriginsKey": "ADMIN_EMBED_ORIGINS",
          "invariants": {
            "description": "Enforced against EVERY declared topology, not just the selected one, so a wrong table entry cannot hide until the switch flips. cookieDomain must be the web host itself, and the public API must either BE that web host (same-origin, the #1575 target) or sit strictly under it; otherwise the front/back shared suffix climbs one level and session cookies reach hosts this blog does not own. forbiddenCookieDomains names the hosts another service owns.",
            "forbiddenCookieDomains": ["aquilaxk.site", "www.aquilaxk.site"]
          },
          "topologies": {
            "blog.aquilaxk.site": {
              "cookieDomain": "blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "frontHost": "blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "webHost": "blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "backHost": "blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "publicEdgeProbeBaseUrl": "https://blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "adminEmbedOrigins": "https://blog.aquilaxk.site",
              "revalidateUrl": "https://blog.aquilaxk.site/api/revalidate"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "pathWithin",
          "parentKey": "AQUILA_EXTERNAL_STORAGE_ROOT",
          "childKey": "AQUILA_BACKUP_ROOT",
          "defaultParent": "/mnt/aquila-blog-data",
          "strict": true
        },
        {
          "type": "pathNotWithin",
          "parentKey": "AQUILA_EXTERNAL_STORAGE_ROOT",
          "childKey": "AQUILA_BACKUP_ROOT",
          "relativeParent": "minio",
          "defaultParent": "/mnt/aquila-blog-data"
        },
        {
          "type": "pathNotWithin",
          "parentKey": "AQUILA_BACKUP_ROOT",
          "childKey": "AQUILA_BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY_FILE",
          "defaultParent": "/mnt/aquila-blog-data/backups"
        },
        {
          "type": "pathNotWithin",
          "parentKey": "AQUILA_BACKUP_ROOT",
          "childKey": "AQUILA_RESTORE_PRIVACY_GATE_SCRIPT",
          "defaultParent": "/mnt/aquila-blog-data/backups"
        }
      ]
    },
    "home-server-runtime": {
      "extends": "home-server-source",
      "description": "Rendered deploy/homeserver/.env.prod after deploy-time runtime-specific backend image injection.",
      "keys": [
        { "name": "BACK_BLUE_IMAGE", "kind": "digest-image" },
        { "name": "BACK_GREEN_IMAGE", "kind": "digest-image" },
        { "name": "BACK_READ_IMAGE", "kind": "digest-image" },
        { "name": "BACK_ADMIN_IMAGE", "kind": "digest-image" },
        { "name": "BACK_WORKER_IMAGE", "kind": "digest-image" },
        {
          "name": "FRONT_BLUE_IMAGE",
          "kind": "digest-image",
          "required": false,
          "description": "Front runtime image for the blue colour (#1538). Digest only; ghcr.io/<owner>/<repo>-front tags are rejected. Optional until #1539 injects it, and the compose front profile stays off while it is empty."
        },
        {
          "name": "FRONT_GREEN_IMAGE",
          "kind": "digest-image",
          "required": false,
          "description": "Front runtime image for the green colour (#1538). Same digest-only rule as FRONT_BLUE_IMAGE."
        }
      ]
    },
    "back-local": {
      "description": "Ignored local backend env generated for devInfra.",
      "render": [
        { "name": "SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE", "fallback": "dev" },
        { "name": "DB_BASE_NAME", "fallback": "blog" },
        { "name": "DEV_DB_PASSWORD", "preserve": true, "fallback": "dev_db_password_change_me" },
        { "name": "DEV_REDIS_PASSWORD", "preserve": true, "fallback": "dev_redis_password_change_me" },
        { "name": "DEV_MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD", "preserve": true, "fallback": "dev_minio_password_change_me" },
        { "name": "SPRING__DATASOURCE__PASSWORD", "from": ["DEV_DB_PASSWORD"], "fallback": "dev_db_password_change_me" },
        { "name": "SPRING__DATA__REDIS__PASSWORD", "from": ["DEV_REDIS_PASSWORD"], "fallback": "dev_redis_password_change_me" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM_PROD_COOKIEDOMAIN", "from": ["CUSTOM_PROD_COOKIEDOMAIN"], "fallback": "blog.aquilaxk.site" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL", "from": ["CUSTOM_PROD_FRONTURL"], "fallback": "https://blog.aquilaxk.site" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM_PROD_BACKURL", "from": ["CUSTOM_PROD_BACKURL"], "fallback": "https://blog.aquilaxk.site" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__JWT__SECRET_KEY", "from": ["CUSTOM__JWT__SECRET_KEY"], "preserve": true, "generate": "hex:48" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__SYSTEM_MEMBER_API_KEY", "preserve": true, "generate": "hex:32" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__ADMIN__USERNAME", "from": ["CUSTOM__ADMIN__USERNAME"], "fallback": "관리자" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__ADMIN__EMAIL", "from": ["CUSTOM__ADMIN__EMAIL"], "fallback": "" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__REVALIDATE__URL", "fallback": "http://localhost:3000/api/revalidate" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__REVALIDATE__TOKEN", "from": ["CUSTOM__REVALIDATE__TOKEN"], "preserve": true, "generate": "hex:32" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__MEMBER__SIGNUP__ENABLED", "fallback": "false" },
        { "name": "CUSTOM__MEMBER__OAUTH_SIGNUP__ENABLED", "fallback": "false" }
      ]
    }
  }
}
